		{"id":"ppj-project-309aebfe21a54f24","type":"text","text":"<!-- PPJ_PROJECT_CARD:QC_ThreadTraceability_v1.0.0 -->\n\n## [[03_Projects/PPJ XPrimo1D RFID Thread|QC_ThreadTraceability_v1.0.0]]\n\nDomain: QC / TQM\nDelivery Stream: EXTERNAL DEVELOPMENT\nDelivery Stage: ANALYSIS\nLifecycle: Pre-PoC / Business Case\nStatus: External Collaboration\nProgress: TBD\nPriority: Decision\nGate: Business/customer case decision\n\nOutcome\n- Evaluate RFID / thread identification and traceability only when QC need, MER commercial case, customer willingness to pay and factory feasibility align.\n\nBoard\n- [[03_Projects/PPJ XPrimo1D RFID Thread/Project_Executive_Board|Local Project Board]]","x":10650,"y":1360,"width":700,"height":310},
