		{"id":"ppj-project-d2b4943e2166107c","type":"text","text":"<!-- PPJ_PROJECT_CARD:MER_InvoiceDataRecheck_v1.1.0 -->\n\n## [[03_Projects/MER.CHICOS.INVOICE.RECHECK-AUDIT.v1.1|MER_InvoiceDataRecheck_v1.1.0]]\n\nDomain: Merchandising\nDelivery Stream: INTERNAL DEVELOPMENT\nDelivery Stage: UAT / PRE-GO-LIVE\nLifecycle: Active\nStatus: Active\nProgress: TBD\nPriority: Medium\nGate: Multi-customer invoice, cost and data checking\n\nOutcome\n- Cross-check costing data, commercial cost, invoice data and customer rules, route exceptions to user review.\n\nBoard\n- [[03_Projects/MER.CHICOS.INVOICE.RECHECK-AUDIT.v1.1/Project_Executive_Board|Local Project Board]]","x":4180,"y":2045,"width":700,"height":310},
		{"id":"ppj-project-44046cf68b841188","type":"text","text":"<!-- PPJ_PROJECT_CARD:WH_AWBExtraction_v1.1.0 -->\n\n## [[03_Projects/WH_AWBExtraction_v1.1.0|WH_AWBExtraction_v1.1.0]]\n\nDomain: Warehouse\nDelivery Stream: INTERNAL DEVELOPMENT\nDelivery Stage: DEVELOPMENT\nLifecycle: Active Development\nStatus: Active\nProgress: TBD\nPriority: Medium\nGate: AWB image OCR and DHL email extraction; table/cell understanding and weight/unit reliability\n\nOutcome\n- Canonical umbrella for AWB OCR + DHL email extraction: both channels converge into one validated Canonical AWB Record (AWB number, sender, recipient, pieces, weight, unit, reference, origin, carrier, destination, dates).\n\nBoard\n- [[03_Projects/WH_AWBExtraction_v1.1.0/Project_Executive_Board|Local Project Board]]","x":3350,"y":2045,"width":700,"height":310},
		{"id":"ppj-project-f77acfe7c01cf429","type":"text","text":"<!-- PPJ_PROJECT_CARD:PROD_HangingLineIoT_v1.0.0 -->\n\n## [[03_Projects/PROD.IOT.CHuyenTreo_1|PROD_HangingLineIoT_v1.0.0]]\n\nDomain: Production + Wash\nDelivery Stream: INTERNAL DEVELOPMENT\nDelivery Stage: DEVELOPMENT\nLifecycle: Development\nStatus: Active\nProgress: TBD\nPriority: Medium\nGate: Source and KPI reconciliation\n\nOutcome\n- Provide real-time production-line visibility: Production Line -> IoT / Machine Data -> WISER / INA -> Production Metrics -> Dashboard.\n\nBoard\n- [[03_Projects/PROD.IOT.CHuyenTreo_1/Project_Executive_Board|Local Project Board]]","x":3350,"y":685,"width":700,"height":310},
		{"id":"ppj-project-4af0411d50a41fe9","type":"text","text":"<!-- PPJ_PROJECT_CARD:HR_EmployeeDataPlatform_v1.1.0 -->\n\n## [[03_Projects/HR.SS&PFD.v1.1|HR_EmployeeDataPlatform_v1.1.0]]\n\nDomain: HR\nDelivery Stream: INTERNAL DEVELOPMENT\nDelivery Stage: GO-LIVE / PRODUCTION / SUPPORT\nLifecycle: Production / Expansion\nStatus: Active\nProgress: TBD\nPriority: P8\nGate: Production rollout and data-quality monitoring\n\nOutcome\n- Standardize employee data into a trusted Employee Master and Group HR Data Foundation, and support applicant extraction/prefill.\n\nBoard\n- [[03_Projects/HR.SS&PFD.v1.1/Project_Executive_Board|Local Project Board]]","x":5010,"y":345,"width":700,"height":310},
		{"id":"ppj-project-a6d155c9d7c2c05c","type":"text","text":"<!-- PPJ_PROJECT_CARD:SCP_SourcingChatbot_v2.3.0 -->\n\n## [[03_Projects/SCP.SOURCING.CHATBOT.v2.3|SCP_SourcingChatbot_v2.3.0]]\n\nDomain: Sourcing / Purchasing\nDelivery Stream: INTERNAL DEVELOPMENT\nDelivery Stage: GO-LIVE / PRODUCTION / SUPPORT\nLifecycle: Production\nStatus: Active\nProgress: TBD\nPriority: P9\nGate: Production monitoring, data quality and retrieval quality\n\nOutcome\n- One production application for supplier/material intelligence: Supplier Data + Material Data + Search + Comparison + RAG + Chatbot.\n\nBoard\n- [[03_Projects/SCP.SOURCING.CHATBOT.v2.3/Project_Executive_Board|Local Project Board]]","x":5010,"y":685,"width":700,"height":310},
		{"id":"ppj-project-58e869157cb41b3a","type":"text","text":"<!-- PPJ_PROJECT_CARD:MER_CostingAgenticPlatform_v1.1.0 -->\n\n## [[03_Projects/PPJ.COSTING.AGENT.PLATFORM.v1.1|MER_CostingAgenticPlatform_v1.1.0]]\n\nDomain: Merchandising\nDelivery Stream: INTERNAL DEVELOPMENT\nDelivery Stage: DEVELOPMENT\nLifecycle: Active Development\nStatus: Active\nProgress: TBD\nPriority: P2\nGate: Sew Agent fixes and Wash Agent development\n\nOutcome\n- Generate a Costing / Quotation Package for Merchandising review and customer quotation through one platform.\n\nBoard\n- [[03_Projects/PPJ.COSTING.AGENT.PLATFORM.v1.1/Project_Executive_Board|Local Project Board]]","x":3350,"y":345,"width":700,"height":310},
		{"id":"ppj-project-2025ae2368970fc2","type":"text","text":"<!-- PPJ_PROJECT_CARD:LOG_ExpenseInvoiceProcessing_v1.2.0 -->\n\n## [[03_Projects/PPJ. Expense-Invoices.v1.1|LOG_ExpenseInvoiceProcessing_v1.2.0]]\n\nDomain: Logistics / EXIM\nDelivery Stream: INTERNAL DEVELOPMENT\nDelivery Stage: UAT / PRE-GO-LIVE\nLifecycle: Regional Rollout / UAT\nStatus: Active\nProgress: TBD\nPriority: P4\nGate: Regional rollout, tax rules and invoice validation\n\nOutcome\n- Process Logistics / Import-Export expense invoices with regional and tax rules, invoice validation, user workflow and exception management.\n\nBoard\n- [[03_Projects/PPJ. Expense-Invoices.v1.1/Project_Executive_Board|Local Project Board]]","x":4180,"y":345,"width":700,"height":310},
		{"id":"ppj-project-69715afff8eea9bf","type":"text","text":"<!-- PPJ_PROJECT_CARD:PUR_GDIAutomation_v1.0.0 -->\n\n## [[03_Projects/PUR.GDI Automation|PUR_GDIAutomation_v1.0.0]]\n\nDomain: Sourcing / Purchasing\nDelivery Stream: INTERNAL DEVELOPMENT\nDelivery Stage: DEVELOPMENT\nLifecycle: Active Development / WFX API Integration\nStatus: Active\nProgress: TBD\nPriority: P3\nGate: WFX API integration and GDI data-entry workflow\n\nOutcome\n- Give Purchasing end-to-end package-dispatch tracking through GDI and provide API capability for automated/assisted GDI data entry while preserving WFX transaction control, validation, confirmation and audit.\n\nBoard\n- [[03_Projects/PUR.GDI Automation/Project_Executive_Board|Local Project Board]]","x":3350,"y":1705,"width":700,"height":310},
		{"id":"ppj-project-409252972c2e8b0c","type":"text","text":"<!-- PPJ_PROJECT_CARD:PUR_MaterialAllocation_v1.1.0 -->\n\n## [[03_Projects/PUR.Material.Allocation.v1.2|PUR_MaterialAllocation_v1.1.0]]\n\nDomain: Sourcing / Purchasing\nDelivery Stream: INTERNAL DEVELOPMENT\nDelivery Stage: UAT / PRE-GO-LIVE\nLifecycle: Validation / Stabilization\nStatus: Active\nProgress: TBD\nPriority: P7\nGate: Transaction reliability and exception control\n\nOutcome\n- Validate controlled reallocation of surplus material across eligible OCs: Material Requirement -> Availability -> Allocation -> Validation -> WFX Transaction.\n\nBoard\n- [[03_Projects/PUR.Material.Allocation.v1.2/Project_Executive_Board|Local Project Board]]","x":4180,"y":1705,"width":700,"height":310},
		{"id":"ppj-project-213ae3192a19c737","type":"text","text":"<!-- PPJ_PROJECT_CARD:VITAS.Sharing.202606 -->\n\n## [[03_Projects/VITAS Sharing|VITAS.Sharing.202606]]\n\nDomain: External Collaboration\nDelivery Stream: INTERNAL DEVELOPMENT\nDelivery Stage: CLOSED\nLifecycle: Closed\nStatus: Closed\nProgress: TBD\nPriority: Closed\nGate: Closed event\n\nOutcome\n- Preserve the June 2026 VITAS sharing record.\n\nBoard\n- [[03_Projects/VITAS Sharing/Project_Executive_Board|Local Project Board]]","x":5840,"y":2045,"width":700,"height":310},
		{"id":"ppj-project-fcac77f9a5a7e2a5","type":"text","text":"<!-- PPJ_PROJECT_CARD:MER_POCommit_v1.1.0 -->\n\n## [[03_Projects/MER.PO-Commit|MER_POCommit_v1.1.0]]\n\nDomain: Merchandising\nDelivery Stream: INTERNAL DEVELOPMENT\nDelivery Stage: CLOSED\nLifecycle: Closed\nStatus: Closed\nProgress: TBD\nPriority: Closed\nGate: Closed\n\nOutcome\n- Preserve the closed PO Commit project history (Customer Order -> MER PO Creation; ~70-80% of customer scenarios covered).\n\nBoard\n- [[03_Projects/MER.PO-Commit/Project_Executive_Board|Local Project Board]]","x":5840,"y":1705,"width":700,"height":310},
		{"id":"ppj-candidate-25813e697a012870","type":"text","text":"<!-- PPJ_CANDIDATE_CARD:CPD In-house Pattern Generation -->\n\n## [[03_Projects/_Registry/Project_Update_Proposals/CPD_IN_HOUSE_PATTERN_GENERATION_CURRENT_INITIATIVE|CPD In-house Pattern Generation]]\n\nRegistration: Canonical Code Not Confirmed\nDomain: Fabric / Textiles Technique\nLifecycle: Internal Prototype / Evaluation\nGate: Build-vs-buy benchmark; canonical code pending\n\nNot a pipeline project card until registration is approved.","x":6670,"y":1870,"width":700,"height":320},
		{"id":"ppj-project-45023d44276c38a8","type":"text","text":"<!-- PPJ_PROJECT_CARD:MER_MarketIntelligence_v1.1.0 -->\n\n## [[03_Projects/E-commerce Market Intelligence v.2.3|MER_MarketIntelligence_v1.1.0]]\n\nDomain: Merchandising\nDelivery Stream: INTERNAL DEVELOPMENT\nDelivery Stage: ANALYSIS\nLifecycle: Active Intelligence\nStatus: Active\nProgress: TBD\nPriority: Medium\nGate: Market and customer intelligence delivery\n\nOutcome\n- Turn market, customer, competitor, trend and demand signals into business intelligence for Merchandising.\n\nBoard\n- [[03_Projects/E-commerce Market Intelligence v.2.3/Project_Executive_Board|Local Project Board]]","x":1690,"y":350,"width":700,"height":310},
		{"id":"ppj-project-800833e789be5b29","type":"text","text":"<!-- PPJ_PROJECT_CARD:WASH_SamplingManagement_v1.1.0 -->\n\n## [[03_Projects/WASH.SAMPLING.MANAGEMENT.PORTAL.v1.1|WASH_SamplingManagement_v1.1.0]]\n\nDomain: Production + Wash\nDelivery Stream: INTERNAL DEVELOPMENT\nDelivery Stage: DESIGN\nLifecycle: Analysis / Product Design\nStatus: Active\nProgress: TBD\nPriority: Medium\nGate: Sampling workflow and product design\n\nOutcome\n- Create a PPJ Group Portal workflow for Wash sample requests, planning, wash samples, results and approval.\n\nBoard\n- [[03_Projects/WASH.SAMPLING.MANAGEMENT.PORTAL.v1.1/Project_Executive_Board|Local Project Board]]","x":2520,"y":1025,"width":700,"height":310},
		{"id":"internal-lane-guide-2","type":"text","text":"Process, rules, data, risks and decisions are being clarified.","x":1690,"y":225,"width":700,"height":95},
		{"id":"ppj-project-ae0f6b99dc99df27","type":"text","text":"<!-- PPJ_PROJECT_CARD:FIN_FinanceManagement_v1.2.0 -->\n\n## [[03_Projects/FIN.AI.FINANCE.MANAGEMENT.v1.1|FIN_FinanceManagement_v1.2.0]]\n\nDomain: Finance / Accounting\nDelivery Stream: INTERNAL DEVELOPMENT\nDelivery Stage: DESIGN\nLifecycle: Strategic Active\nStatus: Active\nProgress: TBD\nPriority: P1\nGate: WS2 OC / Cost Control and WS3 Factory Performance\n\nOutcome\n- Centralized Finance Control Platform for completeness, correct OC/period, actual versus plan, missing cost, profitability, drill-down, factory performance and exception ownership.\n\nBoard\n- [[03_Projects/FIN.AI.FINANCE.MANAGEMENT.v1.1/Project_Executive_Board|Local Project Board]]","x":2520,"y":685,"width":700,"height":310},
		{"id":"internal-lane-guide-3","type":"text","text":"Solution, UX, permissions, data and integration are being designed.","x":2520,"y":225,"width":700,"height":95},
		{"id":"ppj-project-1e6dff3455963d01","type":"text","text":"<!-- PPJ_PROJECT_CARD:TD_TechnicalKnowledgePlatform_v2.1.0 -->\n\n## [[03_Projects/TD.TechnicalPlatform_v2.1|TD_TechnicalKnowledgePlatform_v2.1.0]]\n\nDomain: Fabric / Textiles Technique\nDelivery Stream: INTERNAL DEVELOPMENT\nDelivery Stage: UAT / PRE-GO-LIVE\nLifecycle: Sync Validation & Stabilization\nStatus: Active\nProgress: TBD\nPriority: P5\nGate: Sync validation and canonical technical model\n\nOutcome\n- Technical Data Backbone for Pattern, BOM, Consumption, Construction, documents and historical records; upstream source for Costing, Sew Agent, BOM, Consumption, Pattern, Technical Search and Similar Style.\n\nBoard\n- [[03_Projects/TD.TechnicalPlatform_v2.1/Project_Executive_Board|Local Project Board]]","x":4180,"y":1025,"width":700,"height":310},
		{"id":"ppj-project-0d364cbbc88ec371","type":"text","text":"<!-- PPJ_PROJECT_CARD:ACC_GRNSupplierInvoiceBot_v2.3.0 -->\n\n## [[03_Projects/ACC.GRN-SupplierInvoiceBot.v2.3|ACC_GRNSupplierInvoiceBot_v2.3.0]]\n\nDomain: Finance / Accounting\nDelivery Stream: INTERNAL DEVELOPMENT\nDelivery Stage: GO-LIVE / PRODUCTION / SUPPORT\nLifecycle: Production Support\nStatus: Support\nProgress: TBD\nPriority: Support\nGate: Operational stability and exceptions\n\nOutcome\n- Operational automation bot for supplier invoice / GRN processing and system data entry: Validation -> Matching / Business Rules -> Data Preparation -> Automated Data Entry -> Target System -> Exception Handling.\n\nBoard\n- [[03_Projects/ACC.GRN-SupplierInvoiceBot.v2.3/Project_Executive_Board|Local Project Board]]","x":5010,"y":1025,"width":700,"height":310},
		{"id":"executive-title","type":"text","text":"# PPJ SOFTWARE DELIVERY EXECUTIVE CONTROL\n\nTWO CONTROLLED STREAMS: INTERNAL DEVELOPMENT + EXTERNAL DEVELOPMENT\n\nEach stream follows: BACKLOG -> KICK-OFF -> ANALYSIS -> DESIGN -> DEVELOPMENT -> UAT / PRE-GO-LIVE -> GO-LIVE / PRODUCTION / SUPPORT -> CLOSED\n\nDrag a registered card between stream-stage groups and save. The enabled watcher validates and persists the change automatically.\n\nSnapshot: [[03_Projects/_Registry/PPJ_PORTFOLIO_CURRENT_SNAPSHOT|Current Portfolio Snapshot]]","x":0,"y":-620,"width":7400,"height":250},
		{"id":"executive-reading-guide","type":"text","text":"## CONTROL RULES\n\nCard center inside exactly one lane controls Delivery Stream + Delivery Stage. Status overlays do not create duplicate cards. CLOSED reopen requires approval.\n\nSave Canvas -> watcher validates -> Registry/project state is synchronized.","x":7470,"y":-350,"width":1420,"height":240},
		{"id":"stream-title-internal","type":"text","text":"# INTERNAL DEVELOPMENT\n\nEight-stage software delivery control stream.","x":0,"y":-80,"width":6570,"height":130,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"internal-lane-empty-1","type":"text","text":"No current registered project in this stream-stage. The stage remains permanently visible.","x":860,"y":345,"width":700,"height":120},
		{"id":"internal-lane-guide-1","type":"text","text":"Owner, users, problem, scope and success outcome are being aligned.","x":860,"y":225,"width":700,"height":95},
		{"id":"internal-lane-empty-0","type":"text","text":"No current registered project in this stream-stage. The stage remains permanently visible.","x":30,"y":345,"width":700,"height":120},
		{"id":"internal-lane-guide-0","type":"text","text":"Approved project not yet scheduled for kick-off.","x":30,"y":225,"width":700,"height":95},
