		{"id":"ppj-project-2ec8831825e6ee81","type":"text","text":"<!-- PPJ_PROJECT_CARD:PUR_HMLabelProcessing_v1.0.0 -->\n\n## [[03_Projects/PUR.H&M Label-O Processing|PUR_HMLabelProcessing_v1.0.0]]\n\nDomain: Sourcing / Purchasing\nDelivery Stream: INTERNAL DEVELOPMENT\nDelivery Stage: ANALYSIS\nLifecycle: On Hold\nStatus: On Hold\nProgress: TBD\nPriority: Hold\nGate: Business priority paused\n\nOutcome\n- Hold H&M Label-O processing automation pending a scalable business case; name shortened to the actual process.\n\nBoard\n- [[03_Projects/PUR.H&M Label-O Processing/Project_Executive_Board|Local Project Board]]","x":1690,"y":685,"width":700,"height":310},
		{"id":"architecture-reference","type":"file","x":6640,"y":-350,"width":760,"height":240,"file":"02_BA_Knowledge/Enterprise_Architecture/PPJ_Enterprise_Application_AI_Automation_Ecosystem.md"},
		{"id":"ppj-executive-summary","type":"text","x":0,"y":-350,"width":6570,"height":240,"text":"# EXECUTIVE PORTFOLIO SUMMARY | AS OF 2026-09-18\n\nRegistered: 36 | Internal: 30 | External: 6 | Active: 18 | Support: 5 | Closed: 7 | Attention: 6\n\nStages | BACKLOG: 0 | KICK-OFF: 0 | ANALYSIS: 6 | DESIGN: 3 | DEVELOPMENT: 4 | UAT: 5 | GO-LIVE / SUPPORT: 11 | CLOSED: 7\n\nTop priorities | P1 FIN_FinanceManagement_v1.2.0 (DESIGN) | P2 MER_CostingAgenticPlatform_v1.1.0 (DEVELOPMENT) | P3 PUR_GDIAutomation_v1.0.0 (DEVELOPMENT) | P4 LOG_ExpenseInvoiceProcessing_v1.2.0 (UAT) | P5 TD_TechnicalKnowledgePlatform_v2.1.0 (UAT)\n\nDirection | Standardize Data -> Standardize Rules -> Standardize APIs -> Scale Automation / AI\n\n[[03_Projects/_Registry/PPJ_PORTFOLIO_CURRENT_SNAPSHOT|Current Snapshot]] | [[02_BA_Knowledge/Enterprise_Architecture/PPJ_Enterprise_Application_AI_Automation_Ecosystem|Enterprise Ecosystem]] | [[10_Reports/PPJ_ENTERPRISE_ECOSYSTEM_DIAGRAM_UPDATE_20260918|Diagram Update Report]]","color":"5"},
		{"id":"ppj-executive-summary-strip-internal","type":"text","x":0,"y":60,"width":6570,"height":90,"text":"## INTERNAL SUMMARY | 30 PROJECTS | ANALYSIS 2 | DESIGN 2 | DEVELOPMENT 4 | UAT 5 | GO-LIVE / SUPPORT 11 | CLOSED 6","color":"5"},
